<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>OurStick: third-party licences</title>
<link rel="icon" href="/icon.png">
<style>
  body { font: 14px/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 52em; margin: 2em auto; padding: 0 1em; color: #222; background: #fff; }
  pre { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #f6f6f6; padding: 1em; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 12px; }
  h2 { margin-top: 2em; }
  li { margin: 0.1em 0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Third-party licences</h1>
<p>OurStick is made with these open-source libraries, each under the licence
shown. Their source code is at crates.io (https://crates.io/crates/NAME) and
in the repositories they name. OurStick's own code is under the Apache-2.0
licence.</p>
<h2>Licences used</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
  <li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
{{#each licenses}}
<h2 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h2>
<p>Used by:</p>
<ul>
{{#each used_by}}
  <li>{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}{{#if crate.repository}} ({{crate.repository}}){{/if}}</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
